{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Crowning [Bb]jewel [Bbm]of cre[Ab]ation, [Db]Blest [Eb]and [Ab]hal[Eb]lowed, [Ab]sancti[Db]fied;
[Eb7]Time and [Cm7]chang[Ab]es [C]al[C7]l  trans[Fm]cending, [Db]Shared [Ab]for[Db]ev[Eb7]er, [Ab]glo[Bbm7]ri [Ebsus]fied.[Eb]
[Ab]Blessed [Bb]Sabbath [Eb7]made for [Ab]man, [Db]Gift [C]from [Fm]the [Bb7]Cre[Fm7]a [Eb7]tor's [Ab]hand.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Ab][Bb]Blessed [Bbm][Ab]Sabbath [Db][Eb]made [Ab][Eb]for [Ab][Db]man,
[Eb7][Cm7][Ab]Gift [C][C7][Fm]from [Db][Ab][Db]the [Eb7][Ab][Bbm7]Creator's [Ebsus][Eb]hand.
