{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab][Bb]Sin [Bbm][Ab]and [Db]sickness, [Eb][Ab]prayer [Eb][Ab]and [Db]weeping
[Eb7][Cm7][Ab]Cease [C][C7]at [Fm][Db]close [Ab][Db][Eb7]of [Ab][Bbm7]earthly [Ebsus][Eb]days;
[Ab][Bb][Eb7]But [Ab][Db]Thy [C][Fm]Sabbath [Bb7][Fm7]is [Eb7][Ab]eternal,
[Ab][Bb]Joyful [Bbm][Ab]thanks [Db]to [Eb][Ab]Thee [Eb][Ab]we [Db]raise!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab][Bb]Teach [Bbm]us [Ab][Db]Lord, [Eb]in [Ab][Eb]storm [Ab]or [Db]sunshine
[Eb7][Cm7][Ab]How [C][C7]to [Fm][Db]truly [Ab][Db][Eb7]rest [Ab][Bbm7]in [Ebsus][Eb]Thee,
[Ab][Bb]May [Eb7][Ab]Thy [Db][C]Sabbath [Fm][Bb7]peace [Fm7][Eb7]enfold [Ab]us
[Ab][Bb]And [Bbm][Ab]our [Db][Eb]shelter [Ab][Eb]ever [Ab][Db]be.
{end_of_verse}
